+## v0.5 addition — AdaptiveGS
+
+`AdaptiveGS` is exported from the public entry point. Its generic ports organize incomplete S, evidence-driven G reconfiguration, and bounded recursive patch selection. It has no game or reference-solver imports. See the enclosing project `docs/DESIGN-v0.5.md` and `tests/autonomous-core.test.mjs`. The historical `GSEngine` remains for offline references and existing users; the material below describes that earlier runtime. This release does not claim real-model performance.
+
